<title>USA: Buckeye extends Merfin bid.</title>
<headline>Buckeye extends Merfin bid.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckeye Cellulose Corp is extending its C$6.00 per share offer for Merfin International Inc an additional 14 days to April 29.</p>
<p>&quot;Unless Merfin's board promptly agrees to waive the poison pill, we intend to initiate all necessary actions for immediate relief so that Merfin's shareholders can make their own decision on our offer,&quot; said Robert Cannon, Buckeye's chief executive.&quot;</p>
<p>Buckeye makes cellulose. ((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1700))</p>
</text>
